{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"2282","name":"全能美食队·海滩的横行者","desc":"稻妻世界任务","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/17/80663279/41a53cbf3d3742b30dd4261689b9e6fc_3606102663315135639.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"全能美食队·海滩的横行者","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"触发条件\",\"value\":[\"在图示位置与旭东对话\"]},{\"key\":\"等级限制\",\"value\":[\"冒险等阶达到30级\"]},{\"key\":\"特殊限制\",\"value\":[\"完成【全能美食队！】\"]}]}","style":""}],"id":"1367","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"任务概述","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"前置任务\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2283\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/06/380453694/4751f1b480da9c872bd22d12f744eb58_308730757445567355.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"全能美食队！\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2283/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2283/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/06/380453694/4751f1b480da9c872bd22d12f744eb58_308730757445567355.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e全能美食队！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"起始NPC\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/20/76078930/1c974bd959a3fc576ea3967adf1c5d37_2097761958107586438.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"旭东\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"无\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"%E6%97%A0\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/20/76078930/1c974bd959a3fc576ea3967adf1c5d37_2097761958107586438.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e旭东\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e稻妻 神无冢\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"结束NPC\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/20/76078930/1c974bd959a3fc576ea3967adf1c5d37_3296155250029045433.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"旭东\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"无\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"%E6%97%A0\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/20/76078930/1c974bd959a3fc576ea3967adf1c5d37_3296155250029045433.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e旭东\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e稻妻 神无冢\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"后续任务\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e无\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1368","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"任务过程","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e在稻妻的海滩上，你又遇见了「全能美食队」。这回他们似乎是想要捕捉一些生活在雷樱树旁的螃蟹。你接受了他们的委托,准备去雷樱树旁捕捉一些螃蟹…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果在捕捉螃蟹时不慎让其逃走的话,可以再在旁边仔细搜寻其他螃蟹的踪迹…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e在雷樱树旁放置诱饵\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e在雷樱树旁捕捉螃蟹\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e你在雷樱树旁成功地抓到了螃蟹。但不知道,这些螃蟹究竟有何特别之处…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e将捕捉到的螃蟹交给旭东\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e旭东开始了烹饪\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e与旭东对话\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e和旅行者一同享受完美餐后，「全能美食队」离开了…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1369","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"任务奖励","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/12/22/74114945/6ee632dc08f8146408597e4b9001fa98_562748875319549985.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"冒险阅历\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"150\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"无\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"%E6%97%A0\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/12/22/74114945/6ee632dc08f8146408597e4b9001fa98_562748875319549985.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e冒险阅历\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*150\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5566\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/12/22/74114945/4152c9f60480495ffcca5b5494947593_4704636977502086504.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"原石\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"20\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5566/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/